From d10b44f84a9d5aaee7ca16430fd62f78d91242a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:26:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(accounting): source recurring-expense vendor picker from
 Business Partners

The Vendor dropdown on Recurring Expenses pointed at a separate, empty
Vendor table instead of the Business Partners (VENDOR category) list
associations already maintain (e.g. via bulk upload). Vendors are now
picked from Business Partners; a lightweight Vendor bridge row is
created transparently the first time a given partner is picked, since
RecurringExpense.vendor_id is still a hard FK to that table.
---
